    "Unique ZIP entry sets for assets match the corresponding 1.170 APK. Every one of 23 source assets equals local source and baseline payloads; debug assets all unchanged. Performance changes only assets/dexopt/baseline.prof with pro\\0/010 header. Public update manifest remains 1.83/code77."
